SUMMARY:Meet the Author of Abundantly You “Meeting Your Authentic Self”
DESCRIPTION:“This book is for anyone who feels stretched thin and is ready to live with more truth\, rest\, and self-trust.” \nJoin Kelly as she shares what inspired her to write Abundantly You and reads a passage from the book. She’ll also guide you through a relaxing 2-minute meditation—just a little taste of what you can find in her book and on her website. Stick around for a Q&A session\, followed by a short reception with book signing to wrap up the evening. It’s a great chance to connect and dive deeper into your authentic self. \nKelly Ayana Nembhard is a National Board-Certified Health & Wellness Coach and energy healer. You can learn more about Kelly and her work at mywealthinhealth.com
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/meet-the-author-of-abundantly-you-meeting-your-authentic-self/
LOCATION:Exotique\, 319 W Main St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:African-American,Author / Artist Visit,Community Engagement,Cultural,Diversity & Inclusivity,Free,Health,Literary,Meeting
