SUMMARY:OFFICIAL FIFA WORLD CUP 2026 WATCH PARTY
DESCRIPTION:The World Cup is almost here! soccer.com and Adidas host an official FIFA World Cup watch party on June 12th on the ATC Lawn to see the USA vs. Paraguay!\nThis is the @usmnt‘s first match in the Group Stage\, and we encourage everyone to wear denim to show your support for the red\, white and blue. \nKick-off is 9 pm\, but come early to set up your chairs/blankets\, listen to some live music\, and get some food and drinks from one of the restaurants on campus. \nSee you there!
